cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If xppautX was useful in work you publish, please cite it, and cite
  XPPAUT itself: the numerics are Bard Ermentrout's.
title: "xppautX: XPPAUT without X11, with a browser front end"
abstract: >-
  A fork of XPPAUT 8.x that separates the numerics from the X11 front end.
  It adds a library (libxppcore) and xppautX, one X11-free program that
  runs headlessly, speaks a JSON protocol and serves the same
  menus and plots to a browser, on Linux, macOS and Windows.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Muhammad
    family-names: Ahmad
    alias: MuhammadMoustafa
    email: engmuhammadmoustafa@gmail.com
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
    # website: "https://www.linkedin.com/in/<profile>"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MuhammadMoustafa/xppautX"
license: GPL-2.0
keywords:
  - XPPAUT
  - dynamical systems
  - bifurcation analysis
  - ODE
